<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>gitpin</title>
<style>
body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; margin: 2rem auto; max-width: 42rem; padding: 0 1rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #1a1a1a; }
h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
.root { border: 1px solid #d0d0d0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 1rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
.root h2 { margin: 0 0 .5rem; font-size: 1.15rem; }
code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; word-break: break-all; }
.links a { display: inline-block; margin-right: 1rem; }
footer { margin-top: 2rem; color: #666; font-size: .9rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Published on IPFS</h1>
<p>Provider peer ID: <code>{{.PeerID}}</code></p>
{{if .Roots}}
{{range .Roots}}
<div class="root">
<h2>{{.Name}}</h2>
<p>CID: <code>{{.CID}}</code></p>
<p class="links">
<a href="https://inbrowser.link/ipfs/{{.CID}}">Open in browser (inbrowser.link)</a>
<a href="https://ipfs.io/ipfs/{{.CID}}">ipfs.io</a>
<a href="https://dweb.link/ipfs/{{.CID}}">dweb.link</a>
<a href="https://cid.contact/cid/{{.CID}}">Index record (cid.contact)</a>
</p>
</div>
{{end}}
{{else}}
<p>Nothing published yet. Add a file to pins/ and push.</p>
{{end}}
<footer>Served by GitHub Pages. Indexed by cid.contact. Generated by gitpin.</footer>
</body>
</html>
